<!--
    Loaded on top of doseFormGroupDataset.xml to put one dose form in more than one dose form
    group, which is the case CIEL supports: a third dose form group, Oral Liquid (5003), that also
    claims Tablet (5011) as a set member, alongside Oral Solid (5001).

    Oral Liquid is mapped to two routes of administration: ROUTE-ORAL (5031), which Oral Solid is
    mapped to as well, and ROUTE-NASAL (5034), which concept Nasal (5023) claims via a SAME-AS
    mapping. So the routes of Tablet are the union of the routes of both its groups, with Oral
    counted once.
-->
